{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>short</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong> Plinko-style <strong>incremental game</strong> where you shoot gumballs at gears and buy upgrades to make bigger and bigger numbers until you break the game! Enjoy the explosive sense of achievement!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gumball Fun:\u00a0</strong>shoot gumballs at gears and enjoy your time by watching them bounce and spin around! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/77d4d6857d83637343bbbe39bc94f1eb.poster.avif?t=1757534143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/77d4d6857d83637343bbbe39bc94f1eb.webm?t=1757534143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/77d4d6857d83637343bbbe39bc94f1eb.mp4?t=1757534143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Upgrades: </strong>buy upgrades to achieve explosive number growth in unique and surprising ways!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/4fff0c226a293881fa1bae9aa3ef69b1.poster.avif?t=1757534143\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/4fff0c226a293881fa1bae9aa3ef69b1.webm?t=1757534143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724490/extras/4fff0c226a293881fa1bae9aa3ef69b1.mp4?t=1757534143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas